    "summary": "Errata to [Tactica Obliqua](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.serberys-raiders.tactica-obliqua) (Serberys Raiders): in your opponent's [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), whenever an enemy unit finishes moving within 8\" of it, this unit can make 1 of these moves unless it is in **Engagement Range** of an enemy unit:\n\n- a **[Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)** up to D6\"\n- a Normal move up to 6\" that leaves all its models wholly within 6\" of at least 1 friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit",
